      "5": "Probist (provost)",
      "7": "Biscof (bishop)",
      "9": "Erzibiscof (archbishop)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the opposing powers keep their reflexes + a portfolio epithet (distinct per power; framed as the hell-host): Maraxus -> Marach the War-Fire (AS Mearox); Vacidus -> Wachid the Unmaker; Lusanto -> Lusando the Hoard-Worm.",
