      "Erlant": "an iron spear crossed with an oath-ring"
    },
    "religious_orders_pattern": "the Munstar (minster) of [power]: 'the Munstar of Dulro' (the AS shires keep an older Hearg-turned-minster).",
    "saints_pattern": "Wih/Halig [name] (the holy [name]); the hallowed dead and royal saints venerated at the minster.",
